Cell["\<\
It is impossible to compute rank just from minimal polynomial, since minimal \
polynomial only contains information about largest Jordan block, while rank \
requires to know sizes of ALL Jordan blocks. Probably the same should hold \
for MVs as well.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.967699437912475*^9, 3.967699567399181*^9}},
 CellID->2139991201,ExpressionUUID->"303496a8-96d2-4283-a5c4-7f3518a1fb34"],

